-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
PLACEHOLDER — replace with the actual CloudSmith release signing public key.

This file is checked in as a placeholder so that:
  1. Import-CloudSmithAppliance.ps1 can locate the key at a known path.
  2. CI can validate that the key file exists before publishing a release.

The real key is managed in the CloudSmith release pipeline and stored in
kv-hcs-vault-01 (secret: cloudsmith-appliance-signing-pubkey).

To regenerate a key pair with cosign:
  cosign generate-key-pair --output-key-prefix cloudsmith-signing-key

The resulting cloudsmith-signing-key.key (private) stays in Key Vault only.
The cloudsmith-signing-key.pub (this file) is committed to the installer repo.
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
